---
import DashboardLayout from "../../../layouts/DashboardLayout.astro";
import adminICMSPartilhaScript from "../../../scripts/admin-icms-partilha.ts?url";
---

<DashboardLayout
  title="Partilha de ICMS"
  subtitle="Gerencie regras de DIFAL, FCP e combinacoes interestaduais usadas pelo motor tributario"
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <h2>Partilha de ICMS</h2>
    <p>
      Cadastre regras para operacoes interestaduais de saida e mantenha organizada a diferenca entre
      aliquota interna, aliquota interestadual e FCP por contexto fiscal.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="difal-hero">
    <div class="difal-hero__content">
      <span class="difal-hero__eyebrow">Motor tributario</span>
      <h3>Painel administrativo para DIFAL e partilha por UF</h3>
      <p>
        Use esta area para definir o comportamento da partilha em vendas interestaduais, filtrando por
        origem, destino, consumidor final, contribuinte, CFOP, NCM e regime tributario.
      </p>

      <div class="difal-legend">
        <article>
          <strong>Aliquota interna</strong>
          <span>Percentual praticado na UF de destino.</span>
        </article>
        <article>
          <strong>Aliquota interestadual</strong>
          <span>Base para calcular a diferenca do DIFAL.</span>
        </article>
        <article>
          <strong>FCP</strong>
          <span>Adicional destacado quando existir regra especifica.</span>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="difal-stats" class="difal-stats">
      <div class="dashboard-note">Carregando panorama da partilha...</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="base-grid">
    <section class="card card--padded">
      <div class="difal-list-head">
        <div>
          <h3 class="section-title">Base por UF</h3>
          <p>Cadastre a aliquota interna vigente de cada estado para servir de referencia ao motor e ao painel de partilha.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form id="icms-rate-form" class="difal-form difal-form--compact">
        <label>
          UF
          <input name="uf" type="text" maxlength="2" placeholder="SP" required />
        </label>

        <label>
          Aliquota interna
          <input name="internal_rate" type="text" placeholder="18,00" required />
        </label>

        <label>
          FCP padrao
          <input name="fcp_rate" type="text" placeholder="0,00" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Vigencia inicial
          <input name="valid_from" type="date" required />
        </label>

        <label>
          Vigencia final
          <input name="valid_to" type="date" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Fonte
          <input
            name="source_reference"
            type="text"
            placeholder="Conta Azul - Tabela ICMS 2026"
            value="Conta Azul - Tabela ICMS 2026"
          />
        </label>

        <label class="full-width">
          Link da fonte
          <input
            name="source_url"
            type="url"
            placeholder="https://contaazul.com/blog/tabela-de-aliquota-interestadual/"
            value="https://contaazul.com/blog/tabela-de-aliquota-interestadual/"
          />
        </label>

        <label class="full-width">
          Observacao
          <textarea name="notes" rows="3" placeholder="Observacoes sobre vigencia ou fundamento."></textarea>
        </label>

        <div class="full-width form-actions">
          <button class="primary-button" type="submit">Salvar base por UF</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="icms-rate-feedback" class="dashboard-note">
        A plataforma ja traz uma base inicial de 2026. Ajuste quando houver mudanca estadual.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card card--padded">
      <div class="difal-list-head">
        <div>
          <h3 class="section-title">Referencia automatica</h3>
          <p>Escolha origem e destino para ver a combinacao sugerida antes de registrar uma regra detalhada.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="icms-rate-reference" class="dashboard-note">
        Informe UF de origem e destino na regra abaixo para visualizar a referencia automatica de partilha.
      </div>

      <div id="icms-state-rates-list" class="dashboard-note">
        Carregando base estadual...
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <div class="difal-grid">
    <section class="card card--padded">
      <h3 class="section-title">Nova regra de partilha</h3>

      <form id="difal-rule-form" class="difal-form">
        <label>
          Nome da regra
          <input name="name" type="text" placeholder="Ex.: DIFAL consumidor final SP" required />
        </label>

        <label>
          Codigo interno
          <input name="code" type="text" placeholder="Opcional, gerado automaticamente se vazio" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Status
          <select name="status">
            <option value="ACTIVE">Ativa</option>
            <option value="DRAFT">Rascunho</option>
            <option value="INACTIVE">Inativa</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <label>
          Prioridade
          <input name="priority" type="number" min="1" value="100" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Vigencia inicial
          <input name="valid_from" type="date" required />
        </label>

        <label>
          Vigencia final
          <input name="valid_to" type="date" />
        </label>

        <label>
          UF da regra
          <input name="uf" type="text" maxlength="2" placeholder="UF de destino" />
        </label>

        <label>
          CRT
          <input name="crt" type="text" placeholder="Ex.: 1, 2 ou 3" />
        </label>

        <label>
          UF origem
          <input name="issuer_uf" type="text" maxlength="2" placeholder="Ex.: MG" />
        </label>

        <label>
          UF destino
          <input name="recipient_uf" type="text" maxlength="2" placeholder="Ex.: SP" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Escopo da operacao
          <select name="operation_scope">
            <option value="INTERSTATE">Interestadual</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <label>
          Tipo da operacao
          <select name="operation_type">
            <option value="EXIT">Saida</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <label>
          Consumidor final
          <select name="final_consumer_mode">
            <option value="yes">Sim</option>
            <option value="any">Qualquer</option>
            <option value="no">Nao</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <label>
          Destinatario contribuinte
          <select name="recipient_contributor">
            <option value="any">Qualquer</option>
            <option value="yes">Sim</option>
            <option value="no">Nao</option>
          </select>
        </label>

        <label>
          Prefixo CFOP
          <input name="cfop_prefix" type="text" placeholder="Ex.: 610" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Prefixo NCM
          <input name="ncm_prefix" type="text" placeholder="Ex.: 2202" />
        </label>

        <label>
          Aliquota interna
          <input name="internal_rate" type="text" placeholder="Ex.: 18,00" required />
        </label>

        <label>
          Aliquota interestadual
          <input name="interstate_rate" type="text" placeholder="Ex.: 12,00" required />
        </label>

        <label>
          FCP
          <input name="fcp_rate" type="text" placeholder="Ex.: 2,00" />
        </label>

        <label class="difal-form__checkbox">
          <input name="applies" type="checkbox" checked />
          Aplicar esta regra no motor tributario
        </label>

        <label class="full-width">
          Bases legais vinculadas
          <input name="legal_basis_ids" type="text" placeholder="IDs separados por virgula" />
        </label>

        <label class="full-width">
          Justificativa / observacao
          <textarea
            name="reason"
            rows="4"
            placeholder="Ex.: consumidor final nao contribuinte em operacao interestadual para SP."
          ></textarea>
        </label>

        <div class="full-width form-actions">
          <button class="primary-button" type="submit">Salvar regra</button>
        </div>
      </form>

      <div id="difal-feedback" class="dashboard-note">
        Preencha a combinacao fiscal e as aliquotas para registrar a regra de partilha.
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="card card--padded">
      <div class="difal-list-head">
        <div>
          <h3 class="section-title">Regras cadastradas</h3>
          <p>Panorama rapido das configuracoes que o motor usa nas sugestoes interestaduais.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="secondary-link" href="/simulacao">Abrir simulacao tributaria</a>
      </div>

      <div id="difal-rules-list" class="dashboard-note">Carregando regras...</div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <script type="module" src={adminICMSPartilhaScript}></script>

  <style>
    .difal-hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.18), transparent 28%),
        radial-gradient(circle at bottom left, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.18), transparent 30%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #f6fbff 55%, #fff9ef);
    }

    .difal-hero__eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #ccfbf1;
      color: #115e59;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .difal-hero h3 {
      margin: 8px 0 10px;
      font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 36px);
    }

    .difal-hero p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #475569;
      max-width: 64ch;
    }

    .difal-legend {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .difal-legend article {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
    }

    .difal-legend span {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .difal-stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      align-content: start;
    }

    .difal-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.95fr 1.05fr;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .base-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 0.92fr 1.08fr;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .difal-form {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .difal-form--compact {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .difal-form label {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .difal-form input,
    .difal-form select,
    .difal-form textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      font: inherit;
      background: white;
    }

    .difal-form textarea {
      resize: vertical;
    }

    .difal-form__checkbox {
      display: flex !important;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: #f8fafc;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .difal-form__checkbox input {
      width: auto;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .full-width {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    .form-actions,
    .difal-list-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .difal-list-head p {
      margin: 6px 0 0;
      color: #64748b;
    }

    .primary-button,
    .secondary-link {
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 11px 15px;
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .primary-button {
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f766e, #0284c7);
      color: white;
    }

    .secondary-link {
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: white;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .stat-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    }

    .stat-card span {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .stat-card strong {
      font-size: 24px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .stat-card--teal {
      background: #f0fdfa;
    }

    .stat-card--gold {
      background: #fffbeb;
    }

    .stat-card--blue {
      background: #eff6ff;
    }

    .state-rate-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .state-rate-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fbff);
    }

    .state-rate-card__top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .state-rate-card__top strong {
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .state-rate-card__meta {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .state-rate-card__meta div {
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .state-rate-card__meta span {
      display: block;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .state-rate-card__meta strong {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .state-rate-card__footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .state-rate-card__apply {
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: white;
      color: #0f172a;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .reference-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.12), transparent 24%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fbff);
    }

    .reference-card__header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .reference-card__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .reference-pill {
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    }

    .reference-pill span {
      display: block;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .reference-pill strong {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .rule-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .rule-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 16px;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.08), transparent 22%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #f8fbff);
    }

    .rule-card__top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .rule-card__eyebrow {
      color: #0f766e;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .rule-card h3 {
      margin: 6px 0;
    }

    .rule-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #475569;
    }

    .rule-card__metrics {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .rule-card__metrics div {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      background: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.9);
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }

    .rule-card__metrics span,
    .rule-card__grid strong {
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .rule-card__metrics strong {
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1;
      color: #0f172a;
    }

    .rule-card__grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 10px 14px;
    }

    .rule-card__reason,
    .rule-card__footer {
      padding: 12px 14px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .rule-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .rule-badge--active {
      background: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
    }

    .rule-badge--draft {
      background: #fef3c7;
      color: #92400e;
    }

    .rule-badge--inactive {
      background: #e2e8f0;
      color: #334155;
    }

    .dashboard-empty {
      border: 1px dashed var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 18px;
      background: var(--surface-soft);
    }

    .dashboard-empty--error {
      border-color: #fecaca;
      background: #fff7f7;
    }

    .feedback {
      margin-top: 16px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }

    .feedback--success {
      background: #ecfdf5;
      color: #166534;
    }

    .feedback--error {
      background: #fff1f2;
      color: #b91c1c;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1080px) {
      .difal-grid,
      .base-grid,
      .difal-hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .difal-form,
      .reference-card__grid,
      .state-rate-card__meta,
      .rule-card__grid,
      .rule-card__metrics,
      .difal-legend,
      .difal-stats {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</DashboardLayout>
